AECP: The 100% Apache Enterprise Computing Platform
Copyright 2026 AECP Contributors

This product includes software developed at
The Apache Software Foundation (https://www.apache.org/).

AECP deploys and configures the following Apache Software Foundation products:
Apache Pulsar, Apache Flink, Apache Arrow, Apache Solr (Lucene), Apache Ozone,
Apache Iceberg, Apache Zeppelin, Apache Superset, Apache Guacamole, Apache Tomcat.

Apache Ozone embeds Apache Hadoop libraries. Apache Solr embeds Apache Lucene.

Portions of this product bundle systemd unit definitions (systemd is
Copyright Lennart Poettering and systemd contributors, LGPL-2.1+),
used as OS-level process management, not as a bundled component.

